# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and ONNX external-data blobs.
#
# These are excluded deliberately: together they are 8.69 GB and each one is
# far over GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit. Git LFS would not help either —
# the free LFS quota is 1 GB.
#
#   models/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct/model.safetensors           2.18 GB
#   models/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-DSpark/model.safetensors    0.55 GB
#   onnx/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct/model.onnx.data               4.36 GB
#   onnx/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-DSpark/model.onnx.data        1.60 GB
#
# All of it is reproducible — see "Regenerating the weights" in README.md.
# The ONNX *topology* files (model.onnx) ARE committed, so the graphs can be
# inspected and diffed without the weights.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.safetensors
*.onnx.data
*.onnx_data*
*.bin
*.gguf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
